{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主生于1993年4月8日23时34分，新加坡，男性。年柱癸酉，月柱丙辰，日柱己未，时柱丙子。日主己土阴，生于辰月，双丙透干，坐未土强根，土旺印旺，身强。年支酉金食神为用，辰酉合金助食神泄秀，但子未相害，水弱土燥。\n\n阴年男命，大运逆排。出生日距清明（4月5日）约3.86天，1岁10个月起运。第一步大运乙卯（约1995-2005），2001年辛巳流年，命主8岁在乙卯大运中。\n\n**2001辛巳年关键组合：**\n- 大运乙卯，与年柱癸酉形成**卯酉冲**（七杀冲食神），金木交战，主突发伤灾、交通事故、手术血光。\n- 流年辛巳，天干辛金食神透出，与双丙火正印相合（**丙辛合**），印星被合绊，化杀之力尽失，七杀乙木无制直接攻身。\n- 地支巳酉半合金局，加大酉金力量，与卯木七杀激战愈烈；同时巳火印星助火克金，五行混战，金木俱伤。\n- 日支未与卯木半合木局，日主之根被合走，身变虚弱，易遭克害。\n\n此年食神制杀被印星合化为忌，贪合忘制，印失其用，七杀猖獗。卯酉金木相冲，是为刀斧、撞伤之象，极易发生交通意外或手术开刀。原局无水调候，战局燥烈，无遗传病之明显伏笔，且卯酉冲为突发动态，更符合意外血光。故选项D最为吻合。\n\n### 最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 138331, "response_id": "20dd027c-c5bb-4bc9-8be8-e6505ae3db99", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 7338, "total_tokens": 7565, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 6895}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}}
{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q18", "domain": "career", "question": "命主在2022年后的职业/行业情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字，日主己土生于辰月，得令且印星丙火双透，身旺无疑。命局喜金、水、木，忌火、土。年支酉金食神为技艺才能，时柱子水偏财贴身，有食神生财之象。但日支未土为比肩库，又为木库（墓库），与辰土相杂，形成辰未土局，自带墓库象。原局子未相害，酉金为刀，丙火为香火之光，癸酉剑锋金更显锋利。\n\n2023年起进入壬子大运，水势浩大，财星旺盛，但子水加剧子未相害，且与命局辰土半合水局，引发墓库动荡。大运财旺破印，职业必以实际利益为导向，且易接触隐晦、阴暗行业。入殓师五行归属与金（刀具、美容）、水（冰冷、暗流）、木（棺椁，未为木库）紧密相连，恰好契合命局墓库与食神（技术）的组合，而牧师（火土印旺忌神）、网红（火行业）、航运物流（水虽为喜却无驿马官杀配合）皆不如此象明显。由此判断，命主2022年后从事入殓师行业的可能性最大。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q18", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 52219, "response_id": "55be25cf-5e97-4375-a062-163a7caca961", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 2812, "total_tokens": 3027, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2511}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}}
{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q19", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主感情状况为何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "命主八字日主己土，生于辰月，双丙印星贴身，性格保守依赖。感情上男命以正财为妻，原局不显，仅年柱癸水偏财、时柱子水偏财，妻缘浅薄，易有短暂或不正式的感情。日支夫妻宫未土为比肩，与时支子水财星形成子未相穿，这代表婚姻宫受克，感情关系多矛盾、难以和谐。现行壬子大运（31-40岁），正妻星壬水透出，子水伏吟，引动原局子未穿，有结婚之象，但穿害加剧，婚姻痛苦不堪，冲突不断，甚至有离异风险。综合判断，命主已婚但感情极不稳定，正在矛盾激化阶段。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q19", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 31339, "response_id": "a3e9bbab-ee00-4445-9eff-b8784e2dc143", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 1974, "total_tokens": 2201, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1798}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}}
{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q20", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主抑郁症状最严重的年份？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "我们来分析命主的八字和大运流年，判断抑郁最严重的年份。\n\n**1. 命局分析**\n- 八字：癸酉 丙辰 己未 丙子\n- 日主己土，生于辰月，得月令之气。天干双丙火正印贴身生扶，日支未土为强根，时支子水财星被未土克制，年支酉金食神生水但被辰合。整体身极旺，土重为病。\n- 喜用神：木（疏土）、金（泄土）、水（润局）。忌神：火土。\n- 性格：土重印旺，为人固执，不善变通，思虑过重，易钻牛角尖。食神酉金被辰合、被子水泄，快乐表达受限，有抑郁倾向。\n\n**2. 大运走势**\n- 命主1993年生，阴年男命，大运逆排。约1岁起运。\n- 1-10岁：乙卯 (1994-2004)\n- 11-20岁：甲寅 (2004-2014)\n- 21-30岁：癸丑 (2014-2024)\n- 31-40岁：壬子 (2024-2034)\n\n**3. 重点年份分析**\n- **2002年壬午**（乙卯运）：大运七杀虽攻身，但有流年午火印星化杀，木火土相生，无大碍。\n- **2016年丙申**（癸丑运）：大运丑土与日支未土相冲，土越冲越旺。流年申金伤官为用，申子辰三合水局，泄身生财，虽有财旺坏印之象，但毕竟是食伤泄秀的年份，有释放出口，非最重。\n- **2018年戊戌**（癸丑运）：大运癸丑，流年戊戌。与命局辰、未构成辰戌丑未四库全，且丑未冲、未戌刑，土彻底被刑旺。土多埋金，唯一用神酉金食神被厚土窒息。食神为思想、快乐、宣泄之口，被制则思维停滞，极度压抑，有自闭厌世倾向。用神全失，忌神猖獗，是抑郁最严重的年份。\n- **2024年甲辰**（壬子运）：正官甲木合身，大运壬子财旺，水土混杂，压力有，但较戊戌年之土重金埋为轻。\n\n**最终答案：C**", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q20", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 25581, "response_id": "c154d402-22db-4da1-bd89-3e56678ecf3e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 1594, "total_tokens": 1802, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details"